@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title 6.0 Verifikasi Event

actor "Admin" as A
participant "System" as S
database "Database" as D
actor "Organizer" as O

== Tinjau Event ==

A -> S : Buka daftar event pending
S -> D : Ambil data event dengan status pending
D --> S : Daftar event
S --> A : Tampilkan daftar event

A -> S : Pilih event untuk dilihat detailnya
S -> D : Ambil detail event, pembicara, jadwal
D --> S : Detail lengkap
S --> A : Tampilkan detail event

== Approve atau Reject ==

A -> S : Klik Tombol Approve / Reject
S -> D : Update status event (published / rejected)
D --> S : Status terupdate
S -> D : Catat log aktivitas admin
D --> S : Log tersimpan
S --> O : Kirim notifikasi status event ke penyelenggara

@enduml
